'''Carapace Spear''' is the fifth [[Spears|spear]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

The Carapace Spear is capable of dispelling the [[Mist]] of [[Mistlands]] in a 9-meter radius.

